    cross-sectional (Spiliotis et al. 2021 <doi:10.1016/j.asoc.2021.107756>), 
    temporal, and cross-temporal 
    (Rombouts et al. 2024 <doi:10.1016/j.ijforecast.2024.05.008>) frameworks.
